{"id":"n59662-1-8","stage":4,"title":"본론 · 正文","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59662-1-8-1","ko":"언제까지 그렇게 쓸데없는 얘기만 할 거야?","zh":"你到底还要一直说那些没用的废话到什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지","audio":"/audio/8902d9621c6f3af4db86.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"쓸데없는","meaning":"没用，无用","explanation":"쓸데없다：没用，无用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓸데없다","audio":"/audio/eedc7c205d702220eee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16730","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓸데없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸데없는","audio":"/audio/6647aa3bf3bad91c3a72.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기만","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기만","audio":"/audio/291bbd5fddc641f85643.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"하다：表示说这样那样的话；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"还打算……？（询问将来行为）","explanation":"할 거야 是非敬语的将来表达；언제까지 할 거야? 询问还要做多久。这里不是指示代词“那个”。","readings":[{"term":"거","a